    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manaseh Iyo Efrayim Qaybtooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Yuusuf qaybtoodiina wuxuu ka bilaabmay Webi Urdun oo Yerixoo ku ag yaal, biyaha Yerixoo dhankooda bari, taasoo ah xagga cidlada, iyo markii laga tago Yerixoo oo la dhex maro dalka buuraha leh ilaa Beytel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu ka baxay Beytel ilaa Luus, oo wuxuu sii maray ilaa soohdinta reer Arkii iyo ilaa Cataarood; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo wuxuu dhanka galbeed ka maray soohdinta reer Yaafleetii iyo ilaa soohdinta Beytxooroonta hoose iyo tan iyo xataa Geser; oo soohdinta dhammaadkeedu wuxuu ahaa xagga badda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Yuusuf, oo ahaa reer Manaseh iyo reer Efrayim, dhaxalkoodii way qaateen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Efrayim sidii ay reerahoodu ahaayeen soohdintoodii sidan bay ahayd; dalkii ay dhaxalka u heleen dhinaca bari waxaa u xigay Cataarood Addaar, iyo Beytxooroonta sare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo soohdintu waxay galbeed ka mari jirtay Mikmetaah tan ku taal xagga woqooyi, oo soohdintu waxay ka soo wareegtay oo bari ka martay Ta'anad Shiloh, oo waxay bari ka martay Yaanooxaah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo intay Yaanooxaah ka tagto ayay sii martay Cataarood, iyo ilaa Nacaraah, oo waxay gaadhay Yerixoo, markaasay ka sii baxday Webi Urdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xagga Tafuu'axna soohdintu waxay galbeed ka sii martay durdurka reer Qaanaah; oo waxaa dhammaadkeedu ahaa xagga badda. Intaasu waa dhaxalkii reer Efrayim qabiilkoodii u heleen sidii reerahoodii ay ahaayeen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo xataa kulli magaalooyinkii loo soocay reer Efrayim ee ku dhex yiil dhaxalkii reer Manaseh, kuwaas oo ahaa magaalooyinkii oo dhan iyo tuulooyinkoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ma ay eryin reer Kancaankii degganaa Geser; laakiinse reer Kancaan waxay dhex degganaayeen reer Efrayim ilaa maantadan la joogo, oo waxay u noqdeen addoommo u hawshooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
